"EVENTS": {
"archie_craft_chat": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Later - Spitalfields Market",
"speaker": null,
"text": "Archie is eating a falafel wrap and looking at his phone. He waves you over without looking up, which is either comfortable familiarity or mild rudeness. Probably both.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Alright. How'd it go with James, then?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"He taught me how to make the pearls. Basic stuff, but — it worked.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Archie stops chewing. He looks at you with an expression you haven't seen on him before: genuine surprise.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"He actually showed you? How to craft?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"Yeah. Why?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Because James doesn't show people things. James does things, judges people for not knowing how to do them, and considers that a complete interaction. Either he was absolutely desperate, or...\" He tilts his head. \"He saw something worth the bother.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Don't let it go to your head. You're at the bottom of a very long ladder. James has been at this for thirty years and he still considers himself underappreciated, which should tell you something about the ceiling.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"That said — keep practising. Seriously. Being able to craft your own means you're not at the mercy of James's prices, which frankly are a war crime. And it's a marketable skill.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"Marketable how?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Same way the ore is. There's buyers for finished product too — people who want pearls and don't have a James. I can start lining them up. Anything you make that you don't need, bring it to me. We split it down the middle, same as the calc.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He finishes his wrap and bins the wrapper from four metres away. It goes in first time. He doesn't acknowledge this at all.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "archie_craft_chat",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "archieCraftChatSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "canSellConsumables",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_stage",
"value": "free"
}, {
"contact": "archie",
"op": "relation",
"value": 5
}, {
"op": "add_ore",
"qty": 20,
"type": "time"
}, {
"flag": "homeRaidEventPending",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"archie_cultivation": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Whitechapel - behind the old brewery",
"speaker": null,
"text": "The vein is exactly where Archie said: a hairline crack in old brick, humming faintly at a frequency you'd ignore if you didn't already know what you were listening for. Archie's waiting with his hands in his pockets, doing an impression of a man who has never once stood around looking impatient.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Right. It's yours now, so you should know how it actually works, not just what the app tells you.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"The way it's been explained to me, veins are a bit like gardens. If you don't tend to them, they can wither and die, or become wild and overgrown. So you can cultivate, or harvest and prune it\".",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Cultivate helps it grow. Harvesting cuts it down a bit, but gives you some calc.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Prune's how the calc actually comes out. Light prune takes a bit, leaves the rest growing. Hard prune takes more, sets it right back — more calc for your trouble, mind.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Run one all the way down and leave it there, and it won't wait patient for you. Eventually it just collapses and disappears on you. The patch stays, mind, ready to seed again - it's the vein you lose.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"So don't get greedy on something you can't afford to lose. Go on, then - put a session in. I'll watch, so you don't feel like you're talking to brick.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You work the vein the way he showed you. It takes, first go - beginner's luck, or possibly just Archie standing close enough to make failure socially awkward. You can see the glow brighten slightly. Somewhere under Whitechapel, something that used to belong to someone else settles into belonging to you.",
"type": "resolution"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"There. Not complicated. Keep at it, and don't tell anyone else where it is.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}],
"id": "archie_cultivation",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "tutorial_cultivate"
}, {
"contact": "archie",
"op": "relation",
"value": 2
}, {
"flag": "cultivationTutorialSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"contact": "archie",
"kind": "col_a1_intro",
"op": "queue_pending_message",
"text": "Come by the lock-up. Got someone you need to meet. Don't make a thing of it."
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}],
"pin": {
"contact": "archie",
"district": "whitechapel",
"phoneLabel": "Go and see Archie about the vein",
"showWhenFlagsFalse": ["cultivationTutorialSeen"],
"showWhenFlagsTrue": ["archiePartnerSeen"]
}
},
"archie_motion": {
"cards": [{
"label": "A message from Archie",
"speaker": null,
"text": "You've been moving product. It's working. Archie's text simply says: \"good output. call me.\"",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"So the consumables are going well. Got a buyer asking for more pearls and asking if there's anything else on offer. Which made me think — can you make anything else?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"Not yet. James only taught me the pearls.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Yeah. Right. See, James knows how to make about forty different things and he's sitting on all of it. Which is his prerogative, obviously. But I'm thinking — have you got any sort of relationship with him yet? Because it might be worth asking.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"Asking him to teach me more?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Gently. James doesn't respond well to being asked for things directly. Try framing it as being useful to him. Which, actually, you could be — if he's got orders he can't fill, you could take the overflow. Might be the angle.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Worth a try anyway. He's the only craftsman I know who isn't either retired or in prison, so options are limited.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He hangs up before you can ask anything else. You look up James's address in your phone.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "archie_motion",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "archieMotionEventSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"contact": "james",
"kind": "james_motion",
"op": "queue_pending_message",
"text": "Overflow work, if you're capable of it. Come by."
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "contacts"
}]
},
"battersea_hum": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Battersea",
"speaker": null,
"text": "The old power station hasn't generated anything since before your parents were your age, and it still hums, very faintly, like a tooth that's been pulled but hasn't told the nerve yet.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You put your hand flat against the brick for exactly as long as feels socially acceptable to touch a decommissioned building, and come away with a faint charge of physics-type static in your palm.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"deck": {
"barometerState": null,
"district": "battersea",
"excludeIfFlag": null,
"weight": 1
},
"id": "battersea_hum",
