}]
},
"busker_greenwich": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Greenwich Market",
"speaker": null,
"text": "By the market, a busker inflates himself explaining the finer points of the zero meridian to a strictly disinterested crowd. He clocks you before you clock him.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Busker",
"text": "\"You look like someone who deals in the good stuff. I know things - like where some small timers may have stashed some calc. Worth twenty quid to a man who knows how to spend it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [{
"op": "add",
"path": "player.cash",
"value": -20
}, {
"op": "add_ore",
"qty": 1,
"type": "time"
}, {
"flag": "greenwichTipOff",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}],
"label": "Give him £20",
"result_text": "He pockets the note and taps the side of his nose. \"Bus stop outside the McDonalds. Paving stone next to the bench is loose; lift it up and you'll get a nice surprise\". Funnily, he's telling the truth; there's a small stash of calc. Or more accurately, there WAS a small stash of calc."
}, {
"effects": [],
"label": "Keep walking",
"result_text": "You keep walking. He shouts something about the Meridian after you. You don't catch it, and don't ask him to repeat it."
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He's either got something, or he's very good at pretending.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Whether or not he was lying, Greenwich feels marginally more interesting than it did five minutes ago.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"deck": {
"barometerState": null,
"district": "greenwich",
"excludeIfFlag": null,
"weight": 1
},
"id": "busker_greenwich",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"buyer": {
"cards": [{
"label": "The next morning",
"speaker": null,
"text": "Archie texts an address in Shoreditch and the word \"tonight\". You arrive to find him outside a craft beer bar, looking mildly disgusted by its existence.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Right. Same calc from the other night — I held onto it. Buyer's inside. Name's Marcus, finance, collects emotion-type for what he calls 'recreational use'. Don't ask. Just be normal. Or close to it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"This is the same stuff. From when they tried to rob us.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Correct. Which is why having two of us is better than one. You're essentially a deterrent. Like a scarecrow. No offence.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"Some offence.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Noted.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Marcus is exactly what you expected: fleece, Patagonia, very clean trainers. He examines the calc with the careful enthusiasm of someone who has recently read about it online. He pays promptly, which is nice.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"See? Smooth as you like. Most of them are like Marcus. Professional, prompt, no Stanley knife. That's the market we're targeting.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": "Walking back — Shoreditch High Street",
"speaker": null,
"text": "Archie splits the cash on the pavement outside a Pret. The city moves around you, completely indifferent to any of this.",
"type": "resolution"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"So. I've got a contact who knows a lot more about this than I do. Bloke called James — craftsman, Bermondsey. Takes raw calc and makes things out of it. Like the pearls. I've been meaning to introduce you.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"Sure.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"I'll set it up. Give me a bell tomorrow.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}],
"id": "buyer",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "add",
"path": "player.cash",
"value": 40
}, {
"flag": "buyerEventSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_stage",
"value": "sms_archie"
}, {
"contact": "archie",
"from": "player",
"op": "push_message",
"text": "You mentioned a bloke called James. When can we sort that?"
}, {
"contact": "archie",
"op": "push_message",
"text": "Already arranged. Tomorrow — SE1 4YA, storage unit behind the Costcutter. Midday."
}, {
"contact": "archie",
"kind": "james_meeting",
"op": "queue_pending_message",
"text": "Fair warning: James is the best craftsman I know and also the worst person I know. Don't take it personally. He's like that with everyone."
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"camden_shakedown": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Camden",
"speaker": null,
"text": "Two lads corner you near the lock, doing their best impression of menace between a falafel stall and a man selling knock-off headphones. It's not entirely unconvincing.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "One of Them",
"text": "\"Toll for using this bit of pavement. Fifty quid, and we all have a nice afternoon.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [{
"op": "add",
"path": "player.cash",
"value": -50
}],
"label": "Pay £50",
"result_text": "You pay. They seem almost disappointed not to have to do anything. You walk on with your dignity roughly 90% intact."
}, {
"effects": [{
"on_fail": [],
"on_success": [{
"op": "start_street_mugging"
}],
"op": "chance",
"p": 0.4
}],
"label": "Refuse",
"result_text": "You refuse. For a second, nobody moves - whatever happens next happens fast."
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "The third one just stands there, which is somehow worse.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Camden closes back over you like nothing happened. Somewhere, a man is still selling headphones that don't work.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"deck": {
"barometerState": null,
"district": "camden",
"excludeIfFlag": null,
"weight": 1
},
"id": "camden_shakedown",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"city_suit": {
"cards": [{
"label": "The City",
"speaker": null,
"text": "A man in a suit that costs more than your flat buys you a coffee you didn't order, in a café you'd never choose. He introduces himself as \"a friend of a friend\", which in the City means nobody vouches for him.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "The Suit",
"text": "\"I collect fate-type. Recreationally, you understand. Two hundred up front, I match it eightfold if the numbers land. If they don't — well. Markets.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [{
"op": "add",
"path": "player.cash",
"value": -200
}, {
"on_fail": [],
"on_success": [{
"op": "add_ore",
"qty": 8,
"type": "fate"
}],
"op": "chance",
"p": 0.5
}],
"label": "Trade (£200)",
"result_text": "He taps his card against yours and doesn't blink. The transaction completes with the finality of all City transactions — you'll know how it went when you check your ore."
}, {
"effects": [],
"label": "Pass",
"result_text": "\"Suit yourself,\" he says, and you both know exactly which word he chose."
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He's already got his card reader out.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He's gone by the time you check your phone. Some men are only ever passing through.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"deck": {
"barometerState": null,
"district": "city",
"excludeIfFlag": null,
"weight": 1
},
"id": "city_suit",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"col_a1_archie_pry": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You mention Des. Archie's face does the thing it does, which is nothing at all, quite deliberately.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"He's good at ground. Best I know. Leave it there.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [],
"label": "Leave it",
"result_text": "You leave it. He looks briefly grateful and then annoyed with himself for looking grateful."
}, {
"effects": [{
"flag": "colA1AskedAboutDebt",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"event": "col_a1_archie_pry_debt",
"op": "start_event"
}],
"label": "Push",
"result_text": ""
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He very obviously wants to leave it there.",
"type": "choice"
}],
"id": "col_a1_archie_pry",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "contacts"
}]
},
"col_a1_archie_pry_debt": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Four hundred and twenty quid. Fourteenth of March, 2019. I know because I wrote it in the book, because that's what you do.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"He's had six years and about nine conversations to say 'here's your money' and instead I get - \" he does an impression that is unkind and quite accurate - \" 'we're all right, aren't we.'\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "It is four hundred and twenty pounds. Archie has, in the time you've known him, given away a vein.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Also, he's Crystal Palace. Obviously untrustworthy.\" He says it in the specific tone of a man producing a joke because the real answer has run out.",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "So that's what that is. A tenner's worth of grievance with six years of compound interest on it. You stop wondering about it, which is exactly what you were supposed to do.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_archie_pry_debt",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "contacts"
}]
},
"col_a1_closer": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "All three of them are in the yard, which has never happened before and is not, apparently, an occasion. Nadia is sitting on an upturned crate. Des has his bag.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"So there's a spot behind the flats on the other side of the estate. Been looking at it for about a year, wondering.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"It's life. Which is wrong for round here — round here is emotion, everyone knows that. But it's life, and it's good ground, and I don't know what to do with good ground.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"You're the one who's good at putting things in. So.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Des has already got the jar out of his bag. He does not make a speech about it. He does not appear to have considered any other course of action.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Forty units, life. Had it about a month waiting for somewhere to put it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [],
"label": "Thank him",
"result_text": "\"You're all right,\" he says, and means it, and the subject is closed."
}, {
"effects": [],
"label": "Insist on paying",
"result_text": "\"You can pay me back by doing this for somebody else in about a year.\" He hands you the jar. \"That's not me being nice, that's just how the accounting works round here.\""
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You start to say something about paying him back.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "It takes first time. The three of them watch you do it and then go straight back to talking about somebody's boiler.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Later, walking back, you ask Des how you'd actually join. Whether there's someone to ask.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"There's no list. Nobody keeps one.\" He seems mildly amused you'd think there was. \"You've been doing this with us for a month. You're either one of us or you're not, and that's not really my call.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"He means yes.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [{
"faction": "collective",
"op": "join_faction"
}, {
"flag": "colA1Joined",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}],
"label": "I'm in",
"result_text": "\"Right,\" says Des, and that's the ceremony."
}, {
"effects": [{
"flag": "colA1DeferredJoin",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}],
"label": "Not yet",
"result_text": "\"Fair enough.\" He isn't offended. \"Offer doesn't expire. There's nothing to expire.\""
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Behind you, Whitechapel does what it does.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You have a life vein in Whitechapel that a newsagent found and a prospector paid for, and no document anywhere records that any of this happened.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_closer",
"on_complete": [{
"district": "whitechapel",
"op": "scripted_seed",
"oreType": "life",
"tier": "rich"
}, {
"flag": "colA1Stage",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": "complete"
}, {
"flag": "colA1Complete",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_deferred_join": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Right,\" he says, like you've asked him what time it is. \"You're in. Don't need a form for it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "That's it. That's the whole thing. Nobody hands you anything to prove it, and you walk out fractionally more a part of something than you were an hour ago.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_deferred_join",
"on_complete": [{
"faction": "collective",
"op": "join_faction"
}, {
"flag": "colA1Joined",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_des_report": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You give Des the last address. He still doesn't write it down.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"That's the pair, then.\" He's pleased in a way that takes a second to read as pleased. \"Two people who'll have something by the weekend.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Archie all right? We go back — years, that. Had a bit of business once, sorted it out ages ago.\" He says it with the mild warmth of a man recalling a settled account, and moves on before you can ask which business.",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You ask who. He tells you the first names and nothing else, and you realise a beat later that he has told you exactly as much as he'd tell anyone about you.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Nobody's ever raided a vein they didn't know about.\" He says it as a small joke about paperwork. \"That's the whole trick. That's it. That's the entire clever bit.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "By the end of the week, both patches you found have veins in them and neither of them is yours. You are, apparently, fine with this, which is itself new information.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_des_report",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA1DesThreadDone",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_des_report_first_fate": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You give Des one address. He doesn't write it down.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Fate. In the City, no less.\" He's pleased in a way that takes a second to read as pleased. \"That's one. Somebody'll have something by the weekend.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Still want physics off you an' all. No rush — just don't go thinking that's the job done.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "By the end of the week, one patch you found has a vein in it and it isn't yours. You seem fine with this.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_des_report_first_fate",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_des_report_first_physics": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You give Des one address. He doesn't write it down.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Physics. Good — that's somebody sorted by the weekend.\" He's pleased in a way that takes a second to read as pleased.",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Still want a fate patch off you an' all. City, for preference — nobody round here's got the ground for it. No rush.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "By the end of the week, one patch you found has a vein in it and it isn't yours. You seem fine with this.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_des_report_first_physics",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_firm_intimidation": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Three of them, waiting by your exit, in no particular hurry. The one in front has the patient look of somebody doing an errand.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Firm Man",
"text": "\"You've been busy. Fate, physics — bit ambitious for someone who was doing a rent-a-vein in Whitechapel a month ago.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Firm Man",
"text": "\"Nobody's asking you to stop. Just letting you know it's been noticed. There's a difference, and the difference is entirely up to you.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [{
"key": "firmFirstContact",
"op": "log_method",
"value": "backed_off"
}],
"label": "Back off",
"result_text": "You take the long way round. Nothing happens, which is the point — somebody wanted a face and now has one."
}, {
"effects": [{
"key": "firmFirstContact",
"op": "log_method",
"value": "held"
}],
"label": "Hold your ground",
"result_text": "You don't move and you don't say anything. He waits, decides it isn't worth the afternoon, and they go. He is slightly less pleasant on the way past."
}, {
"effects": [{
"key": "firmFirstContact",
"op": "log_method",
"value": "fought"
}, {
"op": "start_street_mugging"
}],
"label": "Tell them where to go",
"result_text": "You tell him. There is a moment where it could still go either way, and then it doesn't."
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He hasn't threatened you. He's been very careful not to.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "The patches are still yours to give away. That was never what this was about.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_firm_intimidation",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA1IntimidationSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"col_a1_firm_skirmish": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You come round the corner into the end of something. Four people, one of them on the floor, and the specific quiet that happens after shouting rather than before it.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Two of them are wearing the kind of coats that cost money. They are not hurrying. One is writing something down.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "By the time you've decided whether to do anything, there are two people and one of them is being helped into a car by the other. Nobody looks at you. It has been arranged that there is nothing to look at.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You ask Des about it later. He says \"Firm,\" the way you'd say \"rain,\" and asks whether you found anything.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_firm_skirmish",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA1SkirmishSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"col_a1_hakim_done": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "The yard looks exactly the same. The vein does not. It reads as taking, and rising.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"That's better than my uncle had it.\" He says this and then looks slightly stricken, as though he has been disloyal.",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He pays you. It is not very much and he has clearly thought about the amount, and there is no version of refusing it that isn't worse.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"Listen. I hear things. Not — I'm not anybody, I just stand here and people talk. If I hear about ground going, round here, I'll text you. That's not me paying you back, that's just — I'll text you.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You have made a newsagent's yard marginally more productive. Somewhere in the calculation of what you have spent your week on, this is either the least or the most important thing, and it won't be clear which for some time.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_hakim_done",
"on_complete": [{
"faction": "collective",
"op": "sell_contact_vein_to_faction",
"price": 0,
"veinIdStatePath": "collective.hakimVeinId"
}, {
"op": "add",
"path": "player.cash",
"value": 120
}, {
"faction": "collective",
"op": "faction_relation",
"value": 10
}, {
"flag": "colA1HakimThreadDone",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "hakimIntelUnlocked",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_hakim_meet": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Whitechapel Road",
"speaker": null,
"text": "The shop sells newspapers, phone credit, and a dozen kinds of crisps, among other things. There is a child's homework on the counter, half done, with a biro resting in the fold.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"You're Des's. He said. Sorry - that came out like you're a dog.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"There's a vein in the yard. Came with the shop. My uncle had it and he was good with it and I'm not, and it's been going backwards for about two years.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "The yard is eleven feet of concrete, three bins and a vein that has clearly not been touched in a long time. It reads as sparse and dropping.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"It does about a third of what it used to. Which is about a third of the rent, so.\" He stops there, having got closer to complaining than he intended.",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"Des says you're good at the growing part. I can't pay you properly. I can pay you something.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [],
"label": "I'll do it",
"result_text": "\"Right. Good. Thank you.\" He busies himself with the till so neither of you has to be looking at the other."
}, {
"effects": [],
"label": "You don't have to pay me",
"result_text": "\"I do, though.\" He says it flatly, and it is the only time he has been immovable about anything. \"I'll pay you something. I'm not having it be a favour.\""
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Behind him, through the doorway, somebody's homework is still half done.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You have taken on somebody's yard. It is not, in any measurable sense, a good use of your afternoons.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_hakim_meet",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "grant_contact_vein",
"statePath": "collective.hakimVeinId",
"vein": {
"alarmUpgrades": [],
"district": "whitechapel",
"growth": 18,
"hospitability": {
"bonuses": [],
"tier": "fair"
},
"location": "Whitechapel Road, the yard behind the newsagent's",
"oreType": "emotion",
"rampantDays": 0,
"security": "none"
}
}, {
"flag": "colA1HakimMet",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}],
"pin": {
"contact": "hakim",
"district": "whitechapel",
"phoneLabel": "Go and meet Hakim",
"showWhenFlagsFalse": ["colA1HakimMet"],
"showWhenFlagsTrue": ["colA1HubReached"]
}
},
"col_a1_hub": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Des has bought you a coffee you didn't ask for and won't let you pay for, which is becoming a pattern.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Right. You've had a fortnight of me giving you things. That's fine, that's how it works, but it works both ways or it doesn't work.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Three things. Take them in whatever order suits. Or don't — I'm not your governor, nobody is.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"One's mine. We've got people who can seed but haven't got ground. I need a fate patch and a physics patch, decent ones, and I need them left alone until I say. You find them, I'll do the rest.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Two's Nadia. Hackney. She moves more calc in a week than the rest of us see in a month and she's short on something. Go and be useful to her; she'll tell you how.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Three's Hakim. Newsagent, Whitechapel Road. He's got a vein in his yard that's on its way out and he hasn't got the hands for it. That one's not a favour to me, it's a favour to him, and he'll be embarrassed about it, so don't make it worse.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He writes two phone numbers on the back of a receipt, which is the only record of any of this that will ever exist.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Three names, three problems, no deadline and no order. The Collective, as far as you can tell, is a group of people who have each independently decided to be helpful and have never once discussed it.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_hub",
"on_complete": [{
"contact": "nadia",
"op": "unlock_contact"
}, {
"contact": "hakim",
"op": "unlock_contact"
}, {
"flag": "colA1DesThreadActive",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "colA1HubReached",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "colA1Stage",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": "hub"
}, {
"flag": "colA1ArchiePryAvailable",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_intro": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Shoreditch",
"speaker": null,
"text": "The footpath shines, wet from the recent rain. Archie is standing outside it with the expression of a man who has already had this conversation in his head and did not enjoy it.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"One vein. That's what we've got. One vein, which is nice, but it's not enough.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"One vein isn't a business, it's a hobby with rent. You want more, you have to go and find ground, and seed it, and I can't teach you that because I've never done it. I shift stock. I don't dig.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He fishes his keys out - a fat bunch, a Millennium Falcon keyring worn smooth at the edges - and lets you both into the lock-up.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"So I called a bloke. He's good. He's the best I know at it, actually.\" A pause exactly long enough to be noticeable. \"He'll teach you. Then he'll go home.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "The man who comes in is in his forties, unhurried, with a canvas bag over one shoulder and the air of somebody who has never once been late but has often waited. He looks genuinely pleased to be here, which nobody else in this story has managed.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Desmond. Des. You're the one with the Whitechapel time vein.\" He says it like a fact he's glad about rather than one he's checking.",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Right. Des knows ground, I know buyers, and between us you might make rent. That's the arrangement.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Archie does not offer Des tea. Des does not appear to expect any. There is a silence with some history in it, and then Archie remembers somewhere else he needs to be.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"He's all right, Archie. Bit of a transaction, but he's all right.\" He's already unpacking the bag. \"Right. Ground.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You have a teacher. Neither of you has mentioned money, which, given your money troubles, is both a relief and slightly unsettling.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_intro",
"on_complete": [{
"contact": "des",
"op": "unlock_contact"
}, {
"flag": "colA1DesMet",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "collectiveLaneUnlocked",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"faction": "collective",
"op": "faction_relation",
"value": 5
}, {
"flag": "colA1Stage",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": "tuition"
}, {
"op": "notify",
"text": "Des reckons there's ground worth a look. Check the map."
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "contacts"
}]
},
"col_a1_nadia_done": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"Right. That's mine now.\" She counts out the money in a way that suggests she has counted out a great deal of money in her life. \"And that's three days a fortnight back.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"You'll get offers, by the way. People who want to buy ground off you cheap because you're new. Don't take them. Ask me first, I'll tell you what it's worth, and I'll tell you straight even when I'm the one buying.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You notice that you actually believe her.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You have sold a vein. There's more money in your account than there was, and slightly less London that belongs to you. Feels like progress.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_nadia_done",
"on_complete": [{
"faction": "collective",
"op": "faction_relation",
"value": 10
}, {
"flag": "colA1NadiaThreadDone",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "vein_list"
}]
},
"col_a1_nadia_meet": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Hackney - the back of a shop that sells phone cases",
"speaker": null,
"text": "Nadia Beckford is about seventy and is moving a crate that you would need help with. She does not accept help.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"Des sent you. He's told you I'm short.\" She doesn't look up. \"He's right. I'm short.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"Standing order. Time calc, every fortnight, same bloke, same amount, been running four years. It pays for a lot of things that need paying for.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"This end of town's full of it and everyone round here has a bit and nobody has thirty units at once. So I spend three days on the phone every fortnight like it's 1974.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [],
"label": "I can get you thirty",
"result_text": "\"Course you can.\" She goes back to the crate. \"Bring it when you've got it. Bring it in bits, I don't care.\""
}, {
"effects": [],
"label": "What's in it for me?",
"result_text": "\"Market rate, same as anyone.\" A pause. \"You were expecting me to be offended. I'm not. Ask people what things cost, it saves everybody a fortnight.\""
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "She finally looks up.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"And before you ask - no, I don't know who's holding what in the collective. Nobody does. If I knew who had what I'd have had this done Tuesday.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Thirty units of time calc, no deadline, no paperwork, and a woman who has been doing this since before you were born treating it as entirely routine.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_nadia_meet",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA1NadiaMet",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_nadia_vein": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"That's the order filled and I'm still doing three days on the phone every fortnight. That's not a solution, that's you being nice.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"So. Different idea. You seed me a time vein and I buy it off you. Then it's mine, it produces, and the standing order fills itself.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"You take the risk - the forty units, the seeding, whether it takes. I take a working vein and pay for it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "It is the first time anyone in the Collective has proposed a transaction to you where both halves were named out loud, and it's oddly restful.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"Grow it a bit first if you've any sense. I'll pay what it's worth on the day, and a hole in the ground with forty units in it isn't worth as much as something you've cultivated.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You now know that a vein is a thing that can be sold, which had genuinely not occurred to you.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_nadia_vein",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "veinSaleUnlocked",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "colA1NadiaAskSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a1_prospecting": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Shoreditch - a service yard behind a coffee place",
"speaker": null,
"text": "Des has brought you to the least interesting place in Shoreditch and is looking at it with open enthusiasm.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Everyone looks for the dramatic bit. Cracked stone, old church, that sort of thing. Mostly what you want is somewhere that's been left alone a long time and had something happen to it once.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Prospecting mainly takes time, and a walk about. You'll turn up a patch or you won't. What you turn up depends on the ground round here and on how much of this you've done before - that's it, that's the whole system.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Patches come in grades. The higher the grade, the more room there is for a vein to grow, and create more calc. Barren ones you leave; nothing takes in them.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Different parts of London tend to skew more to a specific type. Round here it's whatever's going. Whitechapel's emotion, mostly. The City's fate, which probably isn't much of a surprise.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He does not tell you which of these facts is the important one. You get the sense this is on purpose.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Go on. Have a look about. I'll be here.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You spend the better part of an hour looking at brickwork with a seriousness that would embarrass you if anyone you knew walked past. Somewhere under all of it, London is doing what it does.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_prospecting",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA1ProspectingTaught",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}],
"pin": {
"contact": "des",
"district": "shoreditch",
"phoneLabel": "Go prospecting with Des",
"showWhenFlagsFalse": ["colA1ProspectingTaught"],
"showWhenFlagsTrue": ["colA1DesMet"]
}
},
"col_a1_seeding": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Des has a jar in his bag. In the jar is about forty units of somebody's physics calc, and he is holding it the way other people hold a thermos.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Finding a patch is half of it. A patch is just good ground. It doesn't do anything until you put something in it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Forty units of the right type. Has to match what the ground wants — you can't put fate in a life patch and hope. Takes a bit of time to do right, and it doesn't always take. The more you do it, the better you get at it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"When it takes, you've got a vein and the patch is yours. When it doesn't, you've lost the calc and the afternoon, and you have another go when you can afford one.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He says the last part without any particular weight, as a man describing weather.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Which is why nobody round here seeds alone if they don't have to. If I've got forty spare and you've found ground - best not to let it go to waste\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"We don't fuss too much about who owns what; we all help each other. The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He does not appear to think he has said anything unusual, and moves straight on to the practical bit about matching types, which he has now explained twice.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You know how to seed a patch. You do not yet have forty units of anything spare, which is a different problem and, Des would say, a smaller one.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a1_seeding",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA1SeedingTaught",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"contact": "des",
"kind": "col_a1_hub",
"op": "queue_pending_message",
"text": "When you've got a minute. Nothing urgent, but there are three things."
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}],
"pin": {
"contact": "des",
"district": "shoreditch",
"phoneLabel": "Go seed a patch with Des",
"showWhenFlagsFalse": ["colA1SeedingTaught"],
"showWhenFlagsTrue": ["colA1ProspectingTaught"]
}
},
"col_a2_contested_vein": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Camden",
"speaker": null,
"text": "A lock-up off the market that used to be Collective ground. Somebody's changed the padlock. Nobody saw it happen, or nobody's saying.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"That one's the Firm's now. Since sometime after Hakim. Nobody rang to tell us - we just noticed the takings stopped.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [{
"op": "claim_faction_vein",
"siteIdStatePath": "collective.contestedVeinSiteId"
}, {
"key": "a2ContestedVein",
"op": "log_method",
"value": "force"
}],
"label": "Take it back",
"result_text": "You go in like it's still yours, because it still should be. Nobody's there to argue. That doesn't mean nobody notices."
}, {
"effects": [{
"faction": "firm",
"op": "buy_faction_vein",
"siteIdStatePath": "collective.contestedVeinSiteId"
}, {
"key": "a2ContestedVein",
"op": "log_method",
"value": "bought"
}],
"label": "Buy it back",
"result_text": "\"You want it back, there's a price, same as anyone's. We're not precious about it. It's only business, at the end of the day.\" He counts it without looking up. It is the least interesting thing that has happened to him all week."
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Two ways to have it back.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Either way, the lock-up is yours again. Whether it feels like it is a separate question, for later.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a2_contested_vein",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA2ContestedVeinDone",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}],
"pin": {
"district": "camden",
"showWhenFlagsFalse": ["colA2ContestedVeinDone"],
"showWhenFlagsTrue": ["colA2Stage"]
}
},
"col_a2_handler_deferred": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"There's a way to know before it happens. Costs money. Costs the right kind of money, mind, not the kind we're short of.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"No.\" A pause, because he's noticed how that sounded. \"Not because it's wrong. Because it's too soon.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"You start with 'just this once' and you don't notice the year it stopped being once.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "A pause, then \"Fine. We do it the hard way. For now\" ",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Nobody writes it down, but it's agreed, the way things get agreed round here - once, out loud, and never mentioned again unless it stops holding.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a2_handler_deferred",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA2HandlerDeferred",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a2_intro": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Now",
"speaker": null,
"text": "Des writes full sentences. Punctuation, structure, the works. This wasn't that — four separate half-thoughts sent one after another, which is how you know something's wrong before you've even read what it is.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You don't reply. You're already moving.",
"type": "narration"
}],
"id": "col_a2_intro",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "contacts"
}, {
"event": "col_a2_shop",
"op": "start_event"
}]
},
"col_a2_nadia_defend_brief": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"Kit's made — good. There's one place I want eyes on now, more than the rest. You'll get the alert same as ever; when it goes, you'll know why.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"That's what you made it for.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}],
"id": "col_a2_nadia_defend_brief",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "col_a2_pick_nadia_defend_vein"
}, {
"flag": "colA2DefendBriefed",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a2_nadia_ledger": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Nadia's got a ledger out — a real one, not the back of an envelope — and she's already three columns into it by the time you sit down.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"I've started writing it down. Who's got what, where. Not for anyone else — for me, so I stop finding out we've lost something a week after everyone else does.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Feels like something to be careful with, that.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Nobody quite picks that up. Nadia's already turning the page, asking who's carrying what, and the room goes with her — relieved, mostly, to have somewhere to look.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"Right. Sensible split, nothing heroic. Someone finds us fresh ground, someone keeps an eye on the place that's most exposed, everyone chips in on stock. I'll square you up for a start.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"You can't fight and you can't calm anyone down, you can just get hit slightly slower than you used to. Make some Blast. Make a Shield. And do one of the Prank — not because I think you'll need it, because I think you won't reach for it, and you should have the option sat there anyway.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}],
"id": "col_a2_nadia_ledger",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "add",
"path": "player.cash",
"value": 250
}, {
"op": "add_ore",
"qty": 11,
"type": "physics"
}, {
"op": "add_ore",
"qty": 6,
"type": "emotion"
}, {
"flag": "colA2LedgerStarted",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "colA2Stage",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": "hardening"
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"col_a2_pattern": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"It's not just Hakim. Priya had someone on the phone about her window three days ago. Marcus actually got his window put through last week. Sef had a 'friendly visit' from two blokes who complimented his stock.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Three separate visits inside a fortnight. Somebody decided we're worth the bother.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"Right. Something needs doing. I don't much care what order - pick at it as it comes.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Nobody says the word plan. It isn't that, not yet. It's three problems and a room full of people who'd rather be doing something than talking about it.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a2_pattern",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA2Stage",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": "call"
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "contacts"
}, {
"event": "col_a2_handler_deferred",
"op": "start_event"
}]
},
"col_a2_shop": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Whitechapel",
"speaker": null,
"text": "The shop's shutter is halfway down. The blind on the door is turned to closed.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Hakim's on the stool behind the till, holding a tea towel full of ice from the freezer cabinet against his mouth. His lip's split. He keeps trying to talk properly around it.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"I'm fine,\" he says.",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Des and Nadia are already there. Des isn't shouting. He's gone quiet instead, which nobody in the room has seen him do before. It makes everything feel even more serious.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Des",
"text": "\"Two of them. Made an offer for the shop and what's under it. A fair price, they said.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"I said no.\" He tries to shrug and thinks better of it halfway through. \"They didn't love that.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Nobody involved has a name yet. From the way Nadia's talking, you think that will change soon - this attack won't go unanswered.",
"type": "narration"
}],
"id": "col_a2_shop",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA2ShopSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "contacts"
}, {
"event": "col_a2_pattern",
"op": "start_event"
}]
},
"col_a2_vulnerable_site": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Whitechapel",
"speaker": null,
"text": "A railway arch nobody's bothered to lock properly in three years. It's held ore the whole time and nothing's ever gone wrong with it - yet.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Nadia",
"text": "\"That one's ours and it's soft as anything. It was fine while nobody's looking twice at us. We're past that now.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"choices": [{
"effects": [{
"op": "add",
"path": "player.cash",
"value": -150
}, {
"op": "add",
"path": "factions.collective.resources",
"value": 150
}, {
"key": "a2VulnerableSite",
"op": "log_method",
"value": "lookout"
}],
"label": "Fund a lookout (£150)",
"result_text": "You put the money in, so someone doesn't need to pull a second shift and can spend it here, sitting on a crate near the arch most evenings, reading a paper without really reading it."
}, {
"effects": [{
"key": "a2VulnerableSite",
"op": "log_method",
"value": "soft"
}],
"label": "Stay soft and fast",
"result_text": "You leave it as it is. Nobody's ever taken it before, and sometimes a lookout just draws more attention."
}],
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Two ways to leave it.",
"type": "choice"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Either way, the vein keeps doing what it's always done, for now. Whether that keeps being true is a separate question.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_a2_vulnerable_site",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "colA2VulnerableSiteDone",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}],
"pin": {
"district": "whitechapel",
"showWhenFlagsFalse": ["colA2VulnerableSiteDone"],
"showWhenFlagsTrue": ["colA2Stage"]
}
},
"col_hakim_intel": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": "Hakim",
"text": "\"Bloke came in for a Lucozade and wouldn't shut up about the yard behind the launderette. Might be nothing. Thought you'd want it before somebody else does.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "It is on your map now. He will not mention it again and will be embarrassed if you thank him twice.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "col_hakim_intel",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "reveal_site"
}, {
"op": "set_hakim_intel_day"
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "phone"
}]
},
"conclave_watch": {
"cards": [{
"label": "The City",
"speaker": null,
"text": "A man in a good coat stands very still outside a bank that isn't a bank, watching nothing in particular with the specific attention of someone paid to watch nothing in particular. He doesn't look at you. That's how you know he's looked at you.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "By the time you think to look back properly, he's gone, and the space he was standing in has already been filled by three tourists and a Deliveroo rider, as if London itself hurried to paper over the gap.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "You add it to a growing list of things about the City you're choosing not to think about too hard.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"deck": {
"barometerState": null,
"district": "city",
"excludeIfFlag": "conclaveNoticed",
"weight": 1
},
"id": "conclave_watch",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "conclaveNoticed",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"foxes": {
"cards": [{
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "A fox crosses your path at the exact midpoint between two streetlights, pauses to look at you with total lack of interest, and continues on business you'll never be briefed on. London's real nightshift clocks on. You're not on the rota.",
"type": "narration"
}],
"deck": {
"barometerState": null,
"district": "any",
"excludeIfFlag": null,
"weight": 1
},
"id": "foxes",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"heath_dogwalker": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Hampstead Heath",
"speaker": null,
"text": "An older woman with four dogs and the bearing of a small aristocracy nods at you like you're expected. One of the dogs sniffs your bag with professional interest.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Dogwalker",
"text": "\"You're doing the ore thing, aren't you. Everyone up here can tell. Here - Wellington dug this up under an oak.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "She's gone before you can ask which dog is Wellington. All four look equally capable of digging up the past.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"deck": {
"barometerState": null,
"district": "hampstead",
"excludeIfFlag": null,
"weight": 1
},
"id": "heath_dogwalker",
"on_complete": [{
"op": "add_ore",
"qty": 2,
"type": "life"
}, {
"op": "set_screen",
"screen": "map"
}]
},
"home_raid_debrief_loss": {
"cards": [{
"label": "Later",
"speaker": null,
"text": "You come round on the floor. Your ore is gone. The window is open. The rest of the place looks ransacked, though in hindsight it isn't too dissimilar to how it was before; you should probably tidy up a bit more often.",
"type": "tension"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "Archie arrives at seven in the morning. He takes one look at you and puts the coffees down without saying anything for a moment.",
"type": "narration"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Right. How much did they get?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"Most of it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Yeah.\" He sits down. \"This place is a problem. I've been meaning to say something for a while. One lock. Window doesn't close. It's practically a service entrance.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"You alright, though? Properly?\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "You",
"text": "\"I'm fine.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Good. Because here's the thing - you're still here, you still fought back, and that counts for something. I've worked with people who'd have just handed it over.\" He pauses. \"Some of them were me, early on.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"I think it's time we made this official. Partners. Properly. Which means I've got a responsibility to make sure you're not operating out of a place someone can stroll into at three in the morning.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"Got a bloke who does security - good stuff, fair price, no paperwork. And you need to start thinking about moving somewhere better. This is the kind of place that keeps happening to you until you leave it.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": "Archie",
"text": "\"And - the vein. Time vein, Whitechapel. I said I'd give it to you and I meant it. It's barely tapped. Needs cultivating before it'll produce anything, but it's a start. Build it up, prune it, make pearls. I'll sort the buyers.\"",
"type": "speaker"
}, {
"label": null,
"speaker": null,
"text": "He stays until you've eaten something, which you didn't ask for and didn't expect. Then he leaves. You check your phone. There's a pin location. The vein.",
"type": "resolution"
}],
"id": "home_raid_debrief_loss",
"on_complete": [{
"flag": "homeRaidEventSeen",
"op": "set_flag",
"value": true
}, {
"flag": "homeRaidWon",
